==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Garbodor|169}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
**Both cards feature the '''Sludge Whirlpool''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Koga's Muk|26}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

